window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-kanzaki-ryuuji"]=[{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p214-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6 sec  6 2  the one who wanted the compromise the entranceway after the hearing  he has been waiting with ichinose for the result  he is present as ichinose s second rather than as a party to the case  the narrator records his position first through disagreement   kanzaki in particular insisted that we d made the wrong choice   the fact remains that he hit the other students  your opponents made a concession because of corroboration from the witness and her evidence  you should ve accepted the compromise   he might not just be sent back to square one  it might be worse  actually  if the school knew both sides shared the responsibility  they d take that into account when assigning punishments  however  if sudou s share of the blame increases tomorrow  it ll be bad news  his argument is institutional  not moral  a shared fault settlement caps the loss  while a retrial can increase sudou s share of blame   i ll do my absolute best to look for more evidence or another witness   we re in too deep now  besides  it s like we said before  we can t forgive liars  he loses the argument and then works the losing side anyway  the narrator s verdict is  these were really good people","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p214-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6.2: the one who wanted the compromise<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.214–215<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The entranceway after the hearing; he has been waiting with Ichinose for the result.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The fact remains that he hit the other students. Your opponents made a concession because of corroboration from the witness and her evidence. You should’ve accepted the compromise.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;He might not just be sent back to square one. It might be worse, actually. If the school knew both sides shared the responsibility, they’d take that into account when assigning punishments. However, if Sudou’s share of the blame…<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I’ll do my absolute best to look for more evidence or another witness.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He is present as Ichinose&#x27;s second rather than as a party to the case.<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The narrator records his position first through disagreement: &quot;Kanzaki in particular insisted that we’d made the wrong choice.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;He might not just be sent back to square one. It might be worse, actually. If the school knew both sides shared the responsibility, they’d take that into account when assigning punishments. However, if Sudou’s share of the blame increases tomorrow, it’ll be bad news.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> His argument is institutional, not moral: a shared-fault settlement caps the loss, while a retrial can increase Sudou&#x27;s share of blame.<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;We’re in too deep now. Besides, it’s like we said before. We can’t forgive liars.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He loses the argument and then works the losing side anyway; the narrator&#x27;s verdict is &quot;These were really good people.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p216-1\">→ After: Ch.6 sec. 6.2: what the request costs<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p216-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami horikita-suzune kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6 sec  6 2  what the request costs horikita s request leaves him silent   kanzaki fell silent and appeared deep in thought   it might be contrary to your ethics and morals  ichinose   yeah  that s what i thought as well  it s something that never should have been done  he names the plan s cost before agreeing to it  and his objection is to the method rather than to helping class d   yeah  that s right  the answer confirms ichinose s guess that class b helped so class d could outpace class c   that could happen  he accepts  without defensiveness  that the favor may later be used against class b  they work as a pair  he takes the hard institutional line and she supplies the accommodation  and neither undercuts the other  he treats her plan as a serious strategy  not a favor  and answers her risk disclosure with agreement rather than reassurance  his earlier part in the case   the bounty flyer on the bulletin board   is not mentioned in this chapter  the page introduces him here only as the friend who disagreed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p216-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6.2: what the request costs<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.216–217<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It might be contrary to your ethics and morals, Ichinose.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Yeah. That’s what I thought as well. It’s something that never should have been done.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Yeah. That’s right.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Horikita&#x27;s request leaves him silent: &quot;Kanzaki fell silent and appeared deep in thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.216<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He names the plan&#x27;s cost before agreeing to it, and his objection is to the method rather than to helping Class D.<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The answer confirms Ichinose&#x27;s guess that Class B helped so Class D could outpace Class C.<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That could happen.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He accepts, without defensiveness, that the favor may later be used against Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> They work as a pair; he takes the hard institutional line and she supplies the accommodation, and neither undercuts the other.<span class=\"pg\">p.214–217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> He treats her plan as a serious strategy, not a favor, and answers her risk disclosure with agreement rather than reassurance.<span class=\"pg\">p.216–217<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> His earlier part in the case — the bounty flyer on the bulletin board — is not mentioned in this chapter; the page introduces him here only as the friend who disagreed.<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p214-1\">← Before: Ch.6 sec. 6.2: the one who wanted the compromise<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p234-1\">→ After: Ch.7 sec. 7.3: he installs the fake cameras<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p234-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"action","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 7 sec  7 3  he installs the fake cameras he and ichinose bought the cameras  and with the professor installed them during the lunch break  the class b operation is theirs together  she applies the pressure in the corridor  he handles the hardware","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p234-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7 sec. 7.3: he installs the fake cameras<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.234<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q action\">He and Ichinose bought the cameras, and with the Professor installed them during the lunch break.<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> The Class B operation is theirs together: she applies the pressure in the corridor, he handles the hardware.<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v2-p216-1\">← Before: Ch.6 sec. 6.2: what the request costs<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p103-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 3  the river meeting appears at the river with two class b boys in the early morning  surprised to meet class d up and out   first day s over  so i wondered how you were doing  i thought i d check on you  your location s great   did i surprise you  i m sorry  i m not here to cause trouble  apologizes to him directly  hirata greets him by name  gives ayanokoji the class b campsite location without hesitating   there are large broken trees along the path from here to the beach  if you enter the forest to the southwest and walk a bit  you can find our campsite  you shouldn t get lost if you enter by those large trees  if you need something  go ahead and tell her you can come by  the invitation names no one   the her is read across as ichinose from the false accusation case  an inference on ayanokoji s side","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p103-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: the river meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.103<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears at the river with two Class B boys in the early morning, surprised to meet Class D up and out.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“First day&#x27;s over, so I wondered how you were doing. I thought I&#x27;d check on you. Your location&#x27;s great.”<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Did I surprise you? I&#x27;m sorry, I&#x27;m not here to cause trouble.”<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“There are large broken trees along the path from here to the beach. If you enter the forest to the southwest and walk a bit, you can find our campsite. You shouldn&#x27;t get lost if you enter by those large trees. If you need…”<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Apologizes to him directly; Hirata greets him by name.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Gives Ayanokōji the Class B campsite location without hesitating.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “There are large broken trees along the path from here to the beach. If you enter the forest to the southwest and walk a bit, you can find our campsite. You shouldn&#x27;t get lost if you enter by those large trees. If you need something, go ahead and tell her you can come by.”<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The invitation names no one — the her is read across as Ichinose from the false-accusation case, an inference on Ayanokōji&#x27;s side.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p117-1\">→ After: Ch.3 sec. 3.3: at his own camp while Class D visits<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p117-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 3 sec  3 3  at his own camp while class d visits sitting a little way off from ichinose when class d walks into the class b camp  he says nothing during the visit  the pages place him in the background of the scene  ayanokoji credits him with having deduced class d s spending from what he saw at the river that morning  the camp class d found from his directions is hers  he stays out of the exchange while she runs it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p117-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3.3: at his own camp while Class D visits<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.117, p.120<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sitting a little way off from Ichinose when Class D walks into the Class B camp.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He says nothing during the visit; the pages place him in the background of the scene.<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji credits him with having deduced Class D&#x27;s spending from what he saw at the river that morning.<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> The camp Class D found from his directions is hers; he stays out of the exchange while she runs it.<span class=\"pg\">p.117–120<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p103-1\">← Before: Ch.3: the river meeting<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p149-1\">→ After: Ch.5 sec. 5.1: the ghost camp with Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p149-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"action spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 5 sec  5 1  the ghost camp with ichinose arrives with ichinose at the emptied class c camp to read the same ghost town  part of the pair that answers his class a question with the account that sakayanagi and katsuragi quarrel and would see no merit in a rift  the answer to his class a question  the class c points block and the strategy verdicts run untagged between the three  left with the chapter s gaps  confirms her sakayanagi reading when she poses it as a question  and checks his wristwatch to end the visit   katsuragi is a clever guy  but even though sakayanagi isn t around  there probably won t be anyone under her who ll put up resistance  they probably wouldn t do anything to deliberately cause a rift  there wouldn t be any merit in doing so  checks his wristwatch and suggests to ichinose that they head back","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p149-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 sec. 5.1: the ghost camp with Ichinose<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.149–151<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives with Ichinose at the emptied Class C camp to read the same ghost town.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Katsuragi is a clever guy. But even though Sakayanagi isn’t around, there probably won’t be anyone under her who’ll put up resistance. They probably wouldn’t do anything to deliberately cause a rift. There wouldn’t be any merit…”<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Part of the pair that answers his Class A question with the account that Sakayanagi and Katsuragi quarrel and would see no merit in a rift.<span class=\"pg\">p.149–151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The answer to his Class A question, the Class C points block and the strategy verdicts run untagged between the three; left with the chapter’s gaps.<span class=\"pg\">p.149–150<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Confirms her Sakayanagi reading when she poses it as a question, and checks his wristwatch to end the visit.<span class=\"pg\">p.150–151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Katsuragi is a clever guy. But even though Sakayanagi isn’t around, there probably won’t be anyone under her who’ll put up resistance. They probably wouldn’t do anything to deliberately cause a rift. There wouldn’t be any merit in doing so.”<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Checks his wristwatch and suggests to Ichinose that they head back.<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v3-p117-1\">← Before: Ch.3 sec. 3.3: at his own camp while Class D visits<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p56-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune katsuragi-kouhei hirata-yousuke ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 2 sec  2 5  the class b interlude walks quietly past katsuragi s entourage to pull the heat off horikita  then greets hirata s arrival   i don t much like ganging up on people  or threatening other classes   you don t need to waste time on katsuragi  he s just trying to get to you   to horikita  gentlemanly despite not being on good terms with her   hirata  looks like you landed in a troublesome group   oh  i don t think so   when hirata says struggle with him  kanzaki  and katsuragi is inevitable  honest type   long hair without slacker energy  the narration notes ichinose  class b s leader  seems to trust him  and that he faced horikita once during the summer vacation and knows her intellect  rescues her from the gang up  declined without heat  interrupts his threat display  later stands by through the ryuen exchange  reads his group as trouble at a glance  named as the class b leader who trusts him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p56-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.5: the Class B interlude<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.56–57<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walks quietly past Katsuragi’s entourage to pull the heat off Horikita, then greets Hirata’s arrival.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I don’t much like ganging up on people, or threatening other classes.”<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“You don’t need to waste time on Katsuragi. He’s just trying to get to you.” (to Horikita, gentlemanly despite not being on good terms with her)<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hirata, looks like you landed in a troublesome group.”<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh, I don’t think so.” (when Hirata says struggle with him, Kanzaki, and Katsuragi is inevitable)<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Honest type — long hair without slacker energy; the narration notes Ichinose, Class B’s leader, seems to trust him, and that he faced Horikita once during the summer vacation and knows her intellect.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Rescues her from the gang-up, declined without heat.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Interrupts his threat display; later stands by through the Ryūen exchange.<span class=\"pg\">p.56–58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Reads his group as trouble at a glance.<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Named as the Class B leader who trusts him.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p64-1\">→ After: Ch.3: named on the Dragon roster<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p64-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 3  named on the dragon roster one roster line   class b s dragon seat  listed among horikita s dragon group  class b  andou  kanzaki  tsube  ayanokoji flags him as one of the class representatives that makes the list a dream team  dragon groupmate on the biased list","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p64-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: named on the Dragon roster<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.64<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">One roster line — Class B’s Dragon seat.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Listed among Horikita’s Dragon group (Class B: Andou, Kanzaki, Tsube); Ayanokōji flags him as one of the class representatives that makes the list a dream team.<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Dragon groupmate on the biased list.<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p56-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.5: the Class B interlude<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p101-1\">→ After: Ch.3: the helper in another group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p101-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 3  the helper in another group named as one of the only people who could help sakura   already busy in his own group  the only people who could help were ichinose and kanzaki  ichinose was already in ayanokoji s group  so she was stuck","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p101-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: the helper in another group<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.101<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as one of the only people who could help Sakura — already busy in his own group.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The only people who could help were Ichinose and Kanzaki; Ichinose was already in Ayanokōji’s group, so she was stuck.<span class=\"pg\">p.101<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p64-1\">← Before: Ch.3: named on the Dragon roster<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p143-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4.1: the Dragon deadlock<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p143-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ryuuen-kakeru horikita-suzune katsuragi-kouhei kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 4 sec  4 1  the dragon deadlock still inside the dragon room with horikita and ryuuen when ichinose and ayanokoji are waved in  the three way holds until ryuuen leaves  named as the one who should have taken his seat in the group   ryuuen s jab that she ended up elsewhere instead   kanzaki kun isn t the type to take the spotlight    ichinose s read of why class a s refusal doesn t land on him  one of the three holding the deadlock  adds the class b c doubt line when ryuuen pushes the two class version   haven t you ever dreamed of rising up to class b  asked kanzaki  names katsuragi as completely unapproachable to her face   the shared class a read after the interview   i said this yesterday  but katsuragi is completely unapproachable  he ll talk to you  but he won t give an inch  i doubt he ll change his mind before the exam ends  at this point  i think all of class a is taking the same stance  don t you  asked kanzaki  carries the no inch finding out of the room with ichinose s interview as the evidence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p143-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4.1: the Dragon deadlock<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.143–150<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Still inside the Dragon room with Horikita and Ryuuen when Ichinose and Ayanokōji are waved in; the three-way holds until Ryuuen leaves.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Haven’t you ever dreamed of rising up to Class B?” asked Kanzaki.<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I said this yesterday, but Katsuragi is completely unapproachable. He’ll talk to you, but he won’t give an inch. I doubt he’ll change his mind before the exam ends. At this point, I think all of Class A is taking the same…”<span class=\"pg\">p.150<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Named as the one who should have taken his seat in the group — Ryuuen’s jab that she ended up elsewhere instead.<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> “Kanzaki-kun isn’t the type to take the spotlight” — Ichinose’s read of why Class A’s refusal doesn’t land on him.<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> One of the three holding the deadlock; adds the Class B–C doubt line when Ryuuen pushes the two-class version.<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Names Katsuragi as completely unapproachable to her face — the shared Class A read after the interview.<span class=\"pg\">p.150<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I said this yesterday, but Katsuragi is completely unapproachable. He’ll talk to you, but he won’t give an inch. I doubt he’ll change his mind before the exam ends. At this point, I think all of Class A is taking the same stance. Don’t you?” asked Kanzaki.<span class=\"pg\">p.150<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Carries the no-inch finding out of the room with Ichinose’s interview as the evidence.<span class=\"pg\">p.143,150<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p101-1\">← Before: Ch.3: the helper in another group<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p151-1\">→ After: Ch.4: split on the way out<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p151-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 4  split on the way out split from on the way to the ship s deck  ayanokoji notes the party split from kanzaki on the way to the deck s crowd","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p151-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: split on the way out<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.151<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Split from on the way to the ship’s deck.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji notes the party split from Kanzaki on the way to the deck’s crowd.<span class=\"pg\">p.151<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p143-1\">← Before: Ch.4 sec. 4.1: the Dragon deadlock<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p207-1\">→ After: Ch.5 sec. 5.1: named in the VIP arithmetic<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p207-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru kushida-kikyou kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 5 sec  5 1  named in the vip arithmetic named only as one of the dragon group who surely worked to learn the vip   horikita s win still surprises ayanokoji  the pair he expects to have exhausted every angle on kushida s screen  the dragon vip both sides were hunting   hirata s tip already gave ayanokoji the answer  no scene presence  one line of the vip arithmetic","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p207-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 sec. 5.1: named in the VIP arithmetic<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named only as one of the Dragon group who surely worked to learn the VIP — Horikita’s win still surprises Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The pair he expects to have exhausted every angle on Kushida’s screen.<span class=\"pg\">p.207<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> The Dragon VIP both sides were hunting — Hirata’s tip already gave Ayanokōji the answer.<span class=\"pg\">p.207<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No scene presence; one line of the VIP arithmetic.<span class=\"pg\">p.207<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4-p151-1\">← Before: Ch.4: split on the way out<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p176-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6  a passing mention ayanokoji recognizes kanzaki of class b in the crowd  and he nods to the group","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p176-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: a passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.176<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji recognizes Kanzaki of Class B in the crowd, and he nods to the group.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p177-1\">→ After: Ch.6: the Class B join<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p177-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shibata-sou kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6  the class b join he approaches ak as the class b trio joins the pool party of thirteen   i m not good with crowds  he came with shibata and the others and notes they seem happy","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: the Class B join<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.177<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He approaches AK as the Class B trio joins the pool party of thirteen.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “I’m not good with crowds.”<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> He came with Shibata and the others and notes they seem happy.<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p176-1\">← Before: Ch.6: a passing mention<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p185-1\">→ After: Ch.6: reading the wall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p185-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"action spoken","w":"sudou-ken shibata-sou kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6  reading the wall kanzaki reads sudou s threat from the sideline and helps class b keep the ball away from their strongest attacker   sudou kun has a wide defensive range and really high attack power  with shibata he hangs on against sudou but stays on the defensive  class b s only viable strategy is denying sudou the ball  he is the first to name sudou s level of danger for class b  the two of them are the only class b players who manage to hold the line","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p185-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: reading the wall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.185–187<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kanzaki reads Sudou&#x27;s threat from the sideline and helps Class B keep the ball away from their strongest attacker.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Sudou-kun has a wide defensive range and really high attack power.”<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> With Shibata he hangs on against Sudou but stays on the defensive; Class B&#x27;s only viable strategy is denying Sudou the ball.<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> He is the first to name Sudou&#x27;s level of danger for Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> The two of them are the only Class B players who manage to hold the line.<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p177-1\">← Before: Ch.6: the Class B join<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p218-1\">→ After: Ch.7: a passing mention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p218-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"kushida-kikyou ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 7  a passing mention named in the locker room as the boy a girl in kushida s class is interested in  kushida pumps ichinose for intelligence on him to pass back to her classmate  ichinose reports that he is popular  not dating anyone  and hard to interpret","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p218-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: a passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.218–219<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the locker room as the boy a girl in Kushida’s class is interested in.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Kushida pumps Ichinose for intelligence on him to pass back to her classmate.<span class=\"pg\">p.219<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Ichinose reports that he is popular, not dating anyone, and hard to interpret.<span class=\"pg\">p.219<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v4_5-p185-1\">← Before: Ch.6: reading the wall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p88-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"action spoken","w":"ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6 sec  6  the chats at the line kanzaki wins the third group of the 100 metre dash ahead of katsuragi  then meets ayanokoji again in the hurdles  takes first place  katsuragi is third   class b s runner outclasses class a s wall in pure speed   we meet again  said kanzaki   ichinose says you re pretty fast  he replied  carries ichinose s homework on ayanokoji   his ranking and his thought process   into the pre race talk   it didn t seem to me that you were taking the race seriously  kanzaki replied   you know  you re really calm for a high schooler  kanzaki added  he follows with  it s scary    a two word reply kept as note  not a quote row  weighs him as a strategist who would not waste effort holding back  and finishes ahead of him in the heat","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p88-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6: the chats at the line<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.88–98<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kanzaki wins the third group of the 100-metre dash ahead of Katsuragi, then meets Ayanokōji again in the hurdles.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“We meet again,” said Kanzaki.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ichinose says you’re pretty fast,” he replied.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It didn’t seem to me that you were taking the race seriously,” Kanzaki replied.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Takes first place; Katsuragi is third — Class B’s runner outclasses Class A’s wall in pure speed.<span class=\"pg\">p.88<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Carries Ichinose’s homework on Ayanokōji — his ranking and his thought process — into the pre-race talk.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You know, you’re really calm for a high schooler,” Kanzaki added.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He follows with “It’s scary.” — a two-word reply kept as note, not a quote row.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Weighs him as a strategist who would not waste effort holding back, and finishes ahead of him in the heat.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p100-1\">→ After: Ch.6–8: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p100-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6 8  passing mentions named as a class b leader on the capture the flag field  class b s guys face d a with kanzaki and shibata leading them  scavenger hunt enemies  ichinose and kanzaki are currently ayanokouji s opponents","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p100-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6–8: passing mentions<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.100, 162<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as a Class B leader on the capture-the-flag field.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Class B’s guys face D/A with Kanzaki and Shibata leading them.<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Scavenger-hunt enemies: Ichinose and Kanzaki are currently Ayanokouji’s opponents.<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p88-1\">← Before: Ch.6 sec. 6: the chats at the line<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p124-1\">→ After: Ch.6 sec. 6: cavalry horse under a Class B general<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p124-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"action","w":"shibata-sou ryuuen-kakeru kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6 sec  6  cavalry horse under a class b general kanzaki rides in the class b general s cavalry unit against the merged d a mass in the boys  match  that unit is taken down by katsuragi and other class a students after three of their own fall  rides with shibata under the same class b general   one of the two units the coalition must clear before ryuuen  left as sole enemy after this unit and shibata s fall  the d a surround begins","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p124-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6: cavalry horse under a Class B general<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.124–125<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kanzaki rides in the Class B general’s cavalry unit against the merged D/A mass in the boys’ match.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q action\">That unit is taken down by Katsuragi and other Class A students after three of their own fall.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Rides with Shibata under the same Class B general — one of the two units the coalition must clear before Ryuuen.<span class=\"pg\">p.124–125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Left as sole enemy after this unit and Shibata’s fall; the D/A surround begins.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v5-p100-1\">← Before: Ch.6–8: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v6-p115-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami horikita-suzune kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 5  the other half of ichinose s test named by horikita as the class b student in her hypothetical  what if kanzaki kun and horikita had the same problem  ichinose cannot choose between them without hurting someone   the answer that impresses horikita  the impossible choice probe that frames the corner talk  no dialogue or action from kanzaki on these pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v6-p115-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: the other half of Ichinose’s test<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.115<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named by Horikita as the Class B student in her hypothetical: what if Kanzaki-kun and Horikita had the same problem?<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Ichinose cannot choose between them without hurting someone — the answer that impresses Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> The impossible-choice probe that frames the corner talk.<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No dialogue or action from Kanzaki on these pages.<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p11-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"matoba-shinji shibata-sou kaneda-satoru kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 2  cautious class b counterweight in the gym as the class b student who refuses matoba s five minute clock and weighs the all four class multiplier   sorry  i need more time to answer that   it s an interesting proposal  but after the five minutes have passed  the value of joining your group plummets significantly  holds firm against the deadline  predicts class a returns once the window closes  agrees to walk away with shibata  later co signs the four class blend with kaneda and hirata  still ruminating on the all four class math when kaneda pushes the siege","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: cautious Class B counterweight<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.11–43<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the gym as the Class B student who refuses Matoba’s five-minute clock and weighs the all-four-class multiplier.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"matoba-shinji.html\">Matoba Shinji<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"kaneda-satoru.html\">Kaneda Satoru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Sorry, I need more time to answer that”<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It’s an interesting proposal. But after the five minutes have passed, the value of joining your group plummets significantly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matoba Shinji<\/b> Holds firm against the deadline; predicts Class A returns once the window closes.<span class=\"pg\">p.36–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Agrees to walk away with Shibata; later co-signs the four-class blend with Kaneda and Hirata.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–42<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kaneda Satoru<\/b> Still ruminating on the all-four-class math when Kaneda pushes the siege.<span class=\"pg\">p.40–42<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p43-1\">→ After: Ch.2/3: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p43-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 2 3  passing mentions named across the seating and cafeteria pages without individual rows beyond his cited scenes  cited by an ichinose classmate   according to kanzaki kun  the boys came to a decision pretty quickly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p43-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2/3: passing mentions<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.43, 73<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named across the seating and cafeteria pages without individual rows beyond his cited scenes.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Cited by an Ichinose-classmate: “according to Kanzaki-kun, the boys came to a decision pretty quickly.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p11-1\">← Before: Ch.2: cautious Class B counterweight<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p44-1\">→ After: Ch.2: the Ryuuen risk belongs to Class D<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p44-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru hirata-yousuke kaneda-satoru kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 2  the ryuuen risk belongs to class d present in the gym as class b s voice on where ryuuen should sit  tells hirata that helping ryuuen would hurt two other classes    if you weigh the risks  it s not a good idea  pushed by hirata to define  do something about it  holds that class d should own its own problem  notes kaneda and ishizaki may dislike the situation but have no right to saddle b and c with it  names the likely class d reading   cutting ryuuen loose so he sabotages someone else","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: the Ryuuen risk belongs to Class D<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.44–49<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Present in the gym as Class B’s voice on where Ryuuen should sit.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"kaneda-satoru.html\">Kaneda Satoru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Tells Hirata that helping Ryuuen would hurt two other classes — “If you weigh the risks, it’s not a good idea.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Pushed by Hirata to define “do something about it”; holds that Class D should own its own problem.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kaneda Satoru<\/b> Notes Kaneda and Ishizaki may dislike the situation but have no right to saddle B and C with it.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Names the likely Class D reading — cutting Ryuuen loose so he sabotages someone else.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p43-1\">← Before: Ch.2/3: passing mentions<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p85-1\">→ After: Ch.3: named as the proactive Class B exception<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p85-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"shibata-sou ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 3  named as the proactive class b exception not in the room dialogue  named in ayanokoji s read of class b s unusual quiet in group six  passing mention  class b had been  unusually quiet so far  with the exception of certain individuals like kanzaki and shibata  paired with shibata as the two class b names ayanokoji still counts as proactive  part of his leadership map   class b not stepping up except these two","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p85-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: named as the proactive Class B exception<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.85<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Not in the room dialogue; named in Ayanokōji’s read of Class B’s unusual quiet in group six.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention: Class B had been “unusually quiet so far… with the exception of certain individuals like Kanzaki and Shibata.”<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Paired with Shibata as the two Class B names Ayanokōji still counts as proactive.<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Part of his leadership map — Class B not stepping up except these two.<span class=\"pg\">p.85<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p44-1\">← Before: Ch.2: the Ryuuen risk belongs to Class D<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p124-1\">→ After: Ch.4: group map source and bathhouse report<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p124-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei moriyama ryuuen-kakeru matsuo ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 4  group map source and bathhouse report named as leading the mostly class b girls adjacent group map source  later in the night bathhouse with ayanokoji   this is a pretty unusual combination of people   moriyama and the others told me  sounds like you guys really have your hands full with kouenji  his class b heavy group is one of the names karuizawa has memorized for ayanokoji  moriyama and others fed him the group six kouenji trouble report  as about ryuuen  as class b second in command his no rumor answer through miyake s three days is taken as probably true    not on these pages  honest exchange on uneven four class group tension  kanzaki unsurprised","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p124-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: group map source and bathhouse report<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.124–128<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as leading the mostly-Class-B girls’-adjacent group map source; later in the night bathhouse with Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"moriyama.html\">Moriyama<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"matsuo.html\">Matsuo<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“This is a pretty unusual combination of people”<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Moriyama and the others told me. Sounds like you guys really have your hands full with Kouenji.”<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> His Class B–heavy group is one of the names Karuizawa has memorized for Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Moriyama<\/b> Moriyama and others fed him the group-six Kouenji trouble report.<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> As about Ryuuen; as Class B second-in-command his no-rumor answer through Miyake’s three days is taken as probably true.<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matsuo<\/b> — not on these pages.<\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Honest exchange on uneven four-class group tension; Kanzaki unsurprised.<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p85-1\">← Before: Ch.3: named as the proactive Class B exception<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p129-1\">→ After: Ch.4: Class C offer and the Horikita honesty read<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p129-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ichinose-honami shibata-sou ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 4  class c offer and the horikita honesty read offers help if ayanokoji is ever in trouble  names ichinose s high opinion of horikita as honesty   if you re ever in trouble  find me  i d like for our good relationship with class c to continue  ichinose feels the same way  of course   ichinose seems to have a really high opinion of horikita  more so for her honesty than her ability  though  defines her as integrity and promise keeping   unlike sakayanagi or ryuuen  channels ichinose s view as the reason for the class c continuity offer  exasperated sigh at shibata s childish contest  leaves before the albert escalation  honest exchange ends when the towel circle pulls ayanokoji in","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p129-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: Class C offer and the Horikita honesty read<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.129–130<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Offers help if Ayanokōji is ever in trouble; names Ichinose’s high opinion of Horikita as honesty.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“If you’re ever in trouble, find me. I’d like for our good relationship with Class C to continue. Ichinose feels the same way, of course.”<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ichinose seems to have a really high opinion of Horikita. More so for her honesty than her ability, though.”<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Defines her as integrity and promise-keeping — unlike Sakayanagi or Ryuuen.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Channels Ichinose’s view as the reason for the Class C continuity offer.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Exasperated sigh at Shibata’s childish contest; leaves before the Albert escalation.<span class=\"pg\">p.129–130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Honest exchange ends when the towel circle pulls Ayanokōji in.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p124-1\">← Before: Ch.4: group map source and bathhouse report<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p225-1\">→ After: Ch.9: the mostly-Class-B group on the course<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p225-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 9  the mostly class b group on the course his group s runners arrive at ayanokoji s marker ahead of ishizaki s handoff   someone from the mostly class b group led by kanzaki    first runner to reach the marker in that wave  their runner precedes ishizaki into the handoff zone  leadership named only   no dialogue or page presence beyond the group reference","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p225-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.9: the mostly-Class-B group on the course<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.225<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">His group’s runners arrive at Ayanokōji’s marker ahead of Ishizaki’s handoff.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “someone from the mostly Class B group led by Kanzaki” — first runner to reach the marker in that wave.<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Their runner precedes Ishizaki into the handoff zone.<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Leadership named only — no dialogue or page presence beyond the group reference.<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v8-p129-1\">← Before: Ch.4: Class C offer and the Horikita honesty read<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu katsuragi-kouhei ryuuen-kakeru miyake-akito hasebe-haruka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji gymnasium  tracing the rumors to class a gymnasium   kanzaki  class b  confronts hashimoto  class a  with miyake standing between them  tails him all day  then presses the rumor source  hashimoto admits spreading but not originating   continuing from where we left off  hashimoto  what have you been doing after school  you don t belong to any clubs  so why are you here so late   you re not waiting here in order to meet anyone in particular  you re just trying to spread rumors to as many people as you can  aren t you   playing dumb is just a waste of everyone s time  i want to make one thing crystal clear with you  what you and the rest of your class are doing is simply too malicious  it s no different than the type of thing ryuuen would do   rumors can create smoke without a fire as long as there s malicious intent  has asked ichinose directly  believes her after about a year of going through thick and thin with class b   approximately one year  that s how long i ve been going through thick and thin together with class b  that s why i m absolutely certain   in other words  you have no intention of retracting those rumors   these last few days  i ve been doing a thorough investigation on you guys in class a  investigation covers first  second  and third year students who heard the rumors from class a  vague deflections match hashimoto s own   the rumors about ichinose were almost certainly propagated by your class a   was it sakayanagi who gave you instructions to spread the rumors   then who did  she s the only one who can give instructions to you guys in class a other than katsuragi  names her as the only class a superior besides katsuragi who could order the campaign  the other named class a authority in his chain of command question  compares class a s malice to ryuuen s methods  hashimoto counters that ryuuen may be feigning retirement  miyake stands watch between them  kanzaki is troubled by extra arrivals   he wanted to speak alone  group witnesses  hashimoto turns the gossip about girls line toward haruka and airi   ichinose hates extreme conflicts  i m sure that she has a big enough heart to even forgive the people who are defaming her  absolute trust in ichinose under pressure  refuses to doubt her even when she neither confirms nor denies","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Gymnasium: tracing the rumors to Class A<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.43–50<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gymnasium — Kanzaki (Class B) confronts Hashimoto (Class A) with Miyake standing between them.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a> <span class=\"n\">+1 more<\/span><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Continuing from where we left off, Hashimoto. What have you been doing after school? You don’t belong to any clubs, so why are you here so late?”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“You’re not waiting here in order to meet anyone in particular. You’re just trying to spread rumors to as many people as you can, aren’t you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Playing dumb is just a waste of everyone’s time. I want to make one thing crystal clear with you. What you and the rest of your class are doing is simply too malicious. It’s no different than the type of thing Ryuuen would do.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>17 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Tails him all day, then presses the rumor source; Hashimoto admits spreading but not originating.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> “Rumors can create smoke without a fire as long as there’s malicious intent.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Has asked Ichinose directly; believes her after about a year of going through thick and thin with Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Approximately one year. That’s how long I’ve been going through thick and thin together with Class B. That’s why I’m absolutely certain.”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In other words, you have no intention of retracting those rumors.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “These last few days, I’ve been doing a thorough investigation on you guys in Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Investigation covers first-, second- and third-year students who heard the rumors from Class A; vague deflections match Hashimoto’s own.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The rumors about Ichinose were almost certainly propagated by your Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Was it Sakayanagi who gave you instructions to spread the rumors?”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then who did? She’s the only one who can give instructions to you guys in Class A other than Katsuragi.”<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Names her as the only Class A superior besides Katsuragi who could order the campaign.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> The other named Class A authority in his chain-of-command question.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Compares Class A’s malice to Ryuuen’s methods; Hashimoto counters that Ryuuen may be feigning retirement.<span class=\"pg\">p.45, 49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> Miyake stands watch between them; Kanzaki is troubled by extra arrivals — he wanted to speak alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.43–44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Group witnesses; Hashimoto turns the gossip-about-girls line toward Haruka and Airi.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ichinose hates extreme conflicts. I’m sure that she has a big enough heart to even forgive the people who are defaming her.”<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Absolute trust in Ichinose under pressure; refuses to doubt her even when she neither confirms nor denies.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1\">→ After: Bowing out; reported to Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"action spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami hasebe-haruka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji bowing out  reported to ichinose gym dispersal   kanzaki bows and leaves toward the dormitories  walks away while calling the conversation unfinished  hashimoto ends it   our conversation isn t over yet  bows to the group and goes toward the dormitories  reported later   ichinose says he is very gentle and that she told him she was alright  present in the farewell group  never at the cafe or the meeting  only the exit beat and ichinose s report of it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Bowing out; reported to Ichinose<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.51, 72<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Gym dispersal — Kanzaki bows and leaves toward the dormitories.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Our conversation isn’t over yet.”<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Walks away while calling the conversation unfinished; Hashimoto ends it.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Bows to the group and goes toward the dormitories.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Reported later — Ichinose says he is very gentle and that she told him she was alright.<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Present in the farewell group.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Never at the cafe or the meeting; only the exit beat and Ichinose’s report of it.<span class=\"pg\">p.51, 72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p43-1\">← Before: Gymnasium: tracing the rumors to Class A<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p110-1\">→ After: The absent ally and the hard-to-tail list<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p110-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji the absent ally and the hard to tail list not in the classroom  even as her closest ally he did not know the secret  named among the students hashimoto found hard to tail   once every two days at best  does not appear  named in ayanokoji s and hashimoto s passes only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p110-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The absent ally and the hard-to-tail list<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.110, 123<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Not in the classroom; even as her closest ally he did not know the secret.<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Named among the students Hashimoto found hard to tail — once every two days at best.<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Does not appear; named in Ayanokōji’s and Hashimoto’s passes only.<span class=\"pg\">p.110, 123<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p51-1\">← Before: Bowing out; reported to Ichinose<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p144-1\">→ After: The report, the south entrance, the answer to Sakayanagi<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p144-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ichinose-honami sakayanagi-arisu kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji the report  the south entrance  the answer to sakayanagi messages horikita from class b  ichinose out again  and their own board carrying rumors too  his message sets the after school meeting at keyaki mall s southern entrance  chosen to avoid standing out  cannot reach her   two days off in a row  answers slow  homeroom teacher repeating the cold line  the girls  visits bounce off a closed door   two days off in a row  and you still haven t been able to get in contact with ichinose san yourself   it s not that we can t get into contact with her  it s just that she s been slow to respond to us  the most i ve gotten from her was a notification that she s been out sick with a cold   nothing different from usual  just that ichinose is staying home again because she s caught a cold   some of the girls from my class have tried to see her  but it doesn t seem like any of them have been able to get her to open her door  recently in a constant state of stress  unable to relax   uncertainty over the true reason for her absences is justified   that s not what any of us are worried about  we re just concerned about her state of mind  faces her faction s arrival head on at the meeting with horikita and ayanokoji    this has nothing to do with you    then the unity line  he knows the strategy is hers   this has nothing to do with you   i hope you know that the unity of my class won t falter just because of a couple of rumors  suffering precisely because of his modesty and concern for those around him  takes her warning not to let sakayanagi get to him and answers that he knows it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p144-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The report, the south entrance, the answer to Sakayanagi<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.144–149<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Messages Horikita from Class B: Ichinose out again, and their own board carrying rumors too.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Two days off in a row. And you still haven’t been able to get in contact with Ichinose-san yourself?”<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It’s not that we can’t get into contact with her, it’s just that she’s been slow to respond to us. The most I’ve gotten from her was a notification that she’s been out sick with a cold.”<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Nothing different from usual. Just that Ichinose is staying home again because she’s caught a cold.”<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> His message sets the after-school meeting at Keyaki Mall’s southern entrance, chosen to avoid standing out.<span class=\"pg\">p.144–146<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Cannot reach her — two days off in a row, answers slow, homeroom teacher repeating the cold line; the girls’ visits bounce off a closed door.<span class=\"pg\">p.147–148<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Some of the girls from my class have tried to see her, but it doesn’t seem like any of them have been able to get her to open her door.”<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Recently in a constant state of stress, unable to relax — uncertainty over the true reason for her absences is justified.<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s not what any of us are worried about. We’re just concerned about her state of mind.”<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Faces her faction’s arrival head-on at the meeting with Horikita and Ayanokōji — “This has nothing to do with you” — then the unity line; he knows the strategy is hers.<span class=\"pg\">p.148–149<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “This has nothing to do with you.”<span class=\"pg\">p.148<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I hope you know that the unity of my class won’t falter just because of a couple of rumors.”<span class=\"pg\">p.149<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Suffering precisely because of his modesty and concern for those around him.<span class=\"pg\">p.149<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Takes her warning not to let Sakayanagi get to him and answers that he knows it.<span class=\"pg\">p.149<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p110-1\">← Before: The absent ally and the hard-to-tail list<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p170-1\">→ After: Answering Sakayanagi’s bank<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p170-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji answering sakayanagi s bank meets sakayanagi s rescue line at the front of his class and answers for it before ichinose can speak   you said you were here to  rescue  us  sakayanagi   does that mean  you admit to spreading the rumors   if that s the case  then what are you getting at   what about it   that s not something i can say  shields class b s internal affairs and ichinose herself from sakayanagi s questioning   hold on ichinose  you don t have to say anything else right now","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p170-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Answering Sakayanagi’s bank<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.170–171<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meets Sakayanagi’s rescue line at the front of his class and answers for it before Ichinose can speak.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“You said you were here to ‘rescue’ us, Sakayanagi?”<span class=\"pg\">p.169<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Does that mean… you admit to spreading the rumors?”<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“If that’s the case, then what are you getting at?”<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “What about it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s not something I can say.”<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Goal<\/span> Shields Class B’s internal affairs and Ichinose herself from Sakayanagi’s questioning.<span class=\"pg\">p.170<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Hold on Ichinose. You don’t have to say anything else right now.”<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p144-1\">← Before: The report, the south entrance, the answer to Sakayanagi<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p178-1\">→ After: The confession and the school’s intervention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p178-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji the confession and the school s intervention asks ichinose whether she will continue to lead the class   what are you going to do  ichinose  poses the question on behalf of class b","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p178-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The confession and the school’s intervention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.178–180<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Asks Ichinose whether she will continue to lead the class.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“What are you going to do, Ichinose?”<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Poses the question on behalf of Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v9-p170-1\">← Before: Answering Sakayanagi’s bank<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v10-p253-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6  questioning the plan expresses concern when ichinose says she will prevent any expulsions  asking if she is sure   are you sure  ichinose  saying that so confidently  asks how she will make up the four million points shortfall and presses for details about borrowing from nagumo   now how are you going to make up for the rest  i can t imagine that anyone from any of the other classes would be willing to give us so many  not even the upperclassmen  agrees to support ichinose s plan once the repayment terms are clear  questions and supports her plan to save the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v10-p253-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: Questioning the plan<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.253–256<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Expresses concern when Ichinose says she will prevent any expulsions, asking if she is sure. Asks how she will make up the four million points shortfall and presses for details about borrowing from Nagumo. Agrees to support Ichinose’s plan once the repayment terms are clear.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Are you sure, Ichinose? Saying that so confidently…”<span class=\"pg\">p.253<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Now how are you going to make up for the rest? I can’t imagine that anyone from any of the other classes would be willing to give us so many, not even the upperclassmen.”<span class=\"pg\">p.255<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Questions and supports her plan to save the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.253–256<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p170-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ichinose-honami shibata-sou ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 5  reporting class d s harassment stands with ichinose and shibata while shibata complains about class d  notices the ayanokoji group and signals shibata to calm down  questions ichinose s decision to invite class c students to join them  hesitates to discuss the harassment but eventually explains it after shibata speaks openly  confirms that class d has been targeting some class b students and that the harassment has not become physical  analyzes the harassment as pressure and says class b should focus on preparing for the exam  supports and questions her handling of the situation  tries to restrain him and later confirms his account  shares information with him and his group over lunch  discusses class d s tactics with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p170-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: Reporting Class D’s harassment<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.170–183<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Stands with Ichinose and Shibata while Shibata complains about Class D. Notices the Ayanokōji Group and signals Shibata to calm down. Questions Ichinose’s decision to invite Class C students to join them. Hesitates to discuss the harassment but eventually explains it after Shibata speaks openly. Confirms that Class D has been targeting some Class B students and that the harassment has not become physical. Analyzes the harassment as pressure and says Class B should focus on preparing for the exam.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Supports and questions her handling of the situation.<span class=\"pg\">p.170–183<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Tries to restrain him and later confirms his account.<span class=\"pg\">p.170–183<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Shares information with him and his group over lunch.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–183<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Discusses Class D’s tactics with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.175–183<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p171-1\">→ After: Ch.5: Class D harassment<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p171-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 5  class d harassment asks whether they can tell the ayanokoji group   are you sure you can tell them  confirms he spoke to the targeted students   i ve spoken to those two about it myself  and pretty much everything checks out  discusses the situation with her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p171-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: Class D harassment<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.171, 176, 178<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Asks whether they can tell the Ayanokōji Group. Confirms he spoke to the targeted students.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Are you sure you can tell them?”<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’ve spoken to those two about it myself, and pretty much everything checks out.”<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Discusses the situation with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.171, 176, 178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p170-1\">← Before: Ch.5: Reporting Class D’s harassment<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p199-1\">→ After: Year 1, Vol. 11.5 Ch.3 — Depth review: confronting Ryūen over the unfair win<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p199-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji year 1  vol  11 5 ch 3   depth review  confronting ryuen over the unfair win brought in by hashimoto as a middleman to a secret meeting with ryuen in the keyaki mall toilet   i won t trust you  hashimoto  but you re of value   i m sorry ryuuen  i don t think we lost to you   you played dirty to steal the win from us  don t forget this   no  she shouldn t be able to do anything about it   i will   watch me  i ll prove it   i don t know what dirty trick you still have up your sleeve  but i m not the same as ichinose  i won t show mercy  i hate that we lost in our own territory  so i ll fight with everything i ve got   remember what i said  ryuuen  sees through ichinose s weakness   her inability to abandon the weak and handle emergencies   and pledges to be the one to stop ryuen  confronts him over the laxative mental tactics and vows a merciless rematch  accepts his go between role solely because class b and class a share an enemy in sakayanagi  faithful to her leadership but critical of her inability to handle emergencies","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p199-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Year 1, Vol. 11.5 Ch.3 — Depth review: confronting Ryūen over the unfair win<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · <\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Brought in by Hashimoto as a middleman to a secret meeting with Ryūen in the Keyaki Mall toilet.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I won&#x27;t trust you, Hashimoto. But you&#x27;re of value.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;m sorry Ryuuen, I don&#x27;t think we lost to you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.201<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You played dirty to steal the win from us. Don&#x27;t forget this!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.201<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;No, she shouldn&#x27;t be able to do anything about it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I will.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.202<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Watch me. I&#x27;ll prove it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I don&#x27;t know what dirty trick you still have up your sleeve, but I&#x27;m not the same as Ichinose. I won&#x27;t show mercy. I hate that we lost in our own territory, so I&#x27;ll fight with everything I&#x27;ve got.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Remember what I said, Ryuuen.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.205<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sees through Ichinose&#x27;s weakness — her inability to abandon the weak and handle emergencies — and pledges to be the one to stop Ryūen.<span class=\"pg\">p.202–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Confronts him over the laxative/mental tactics and vows a merciless rematch.<span class=\"pg\">p.199–205<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Accepts his go-between role solely because Class B and Class A share an enemy in Sakayanagi.<span class=\"pg\">p.199<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Faithful to her leadership but critical of her inability to handle emergencies.<span class=\"pg\">p.202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11-p171-1\">← Before: Ch.5: Class D harassment<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11_5-p199-1","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru hashimoto-masayoshi ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 3  warning to ryuen kanzaki arrives at the keyaki mall men s toilet after hashimoto arranges a meeting with ryuen  he tells ryuen that class b does not accept the end of year exam result as a fair loss and criticizes his underhanded tactics  kanzaki declares he will act to prevent such methods from working against class b in the future  even if he must step beyond ichinose s usual approach  he leaves after warning ryuen to remember what he said  confronts and warns him about future conflict with class b  meets him through hashimoto s arrangement  states he has supported her but sees limits in her ability to respond to emergencies","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y1v11_5-p199-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Warning to Ryūen<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.199–205<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kanzaki arrives at the Keyaki mall men’s toilet after Hashimoto arranges a meeting with Ryūen. He tells Ryūen that Class B does not accept the end-of-year exam result as a fair loss and criticizes his underhanded tactics. Kanzaki declares he will act to prevent such methods from working against Class B in the future, even if he must step beyond Ichinose’s usual approach. He leaves after warning Ryūen to remember what he said.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Confronts and warns him about future conflict with Class B.<span class=\"pg\">p.199–205<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Meets him through Hashimoto’s arrangement.<span class=\"pg\">p.199–204<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> States he has supported her but sees limits in her ability to respond to emergencies.<span class=\"pg\">p.202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p6-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p6-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.6-354<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1\">→ After: Kanzaki&#x27;s hostility toward Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki s hostility toward ayanokoji waiting with ichinose at keyaki mall  his gaze is fixed more on her than on ayanokoji   judging from last year s oaa  you shouldn t have the strength to get a full score   so you re saying that you ve been hiding it all this time  it looks like you re even more of an issue than i thought   what other abilities are you hiding   our overall scores in class c are much higher than that   it seems like i ve indeed lost my cool  openly suspicious and thorny   presses ayanokoji about the perfect score and other hidden abilities  argues class b can make up the points gap as a whole  and is stopped by ichinose s rare force  admits he lost his cool and leaves first  his reaction understandable given class b s fall to class c  views him as a hidden threat and potential enemy  rejects his explanation as incomplete  his classmate  her naivety frustrates him  but he accepts her criticism","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p47-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kanzaki&#x27;s hostility toward Ayanokōji<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.47–50<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Waiting with Ichinose at Keyaki Mall; his gaze is fixed more on her than on Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Judging from last year&#x27;s OAA, you shouldn&#x27;t have the strength to get a full score.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;So you&#x27;re saying that you&#x27;ve been hiding it all this time. It looks like you&#x27;re even more of an issue than I thought.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;What other abilities are you hiding?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Our overall scores in Class C are much higher than that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It seems like I&#x27;ve indeed lost my cool.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Openly suspicious and thorny — presses Ayanokōji about the perfect score and other hidden abilities, argues Class B can make up the points gap as a whole, and is stopped by Ichinose&#x27;s rare force; admits he lost his cool and leaves first, his reaction understandable given Class B&#x27;s fall to Class C.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Views him as a hidden threat and potential enemy; rejects his explanation as incomplete.<span class=\"pg\">p.47–50<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> His classmate; her naivety frustrates him, but he accepts her criticism.<span class=\"pg\">p.48–50<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v2-p6-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v4-p5-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v4-p5-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.5-284<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v4_5-p10-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v4_5-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.10-290<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v5-p7-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v5-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.7-243<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v5-p127-1\">→ After: Kanzaki&#x27;s principled one-vote stand<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v5-p127-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami hoshinomiya-chie kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki s principled one vote stand  i can only believe that everyone is suffering from normality bias if they don t think it s abnormal that 39 opposing votes were gathered without any hesitation or doubt   if the lower classes prioritize class points over a classmate  then we ll fall down to class d in this special exam   it s the process that i m focusing on   i m sorry  but i m  not going to let you be unanimous in your opposition to this choice   let s face it  shibata  the situation is very different from last year  we re in a tight spot right now   you can choose to agree with me and then expel me   if you don t have the courage to take a step forward in this special exam  then you won t be able to move up to class a  the  general advisor  who quietly supported the class but can no longer endure its lack of crisis awareness   deliberately votes  for  repeatedly to force debate  names  normality bias  and offers himself for expulsion as the only way to shake the class  after hours of deadlock he finally gives up and chooses to protect his classmates  letting the vote become unanimous against  her refusal to weigh points against friends defeats him  he calls her class s kindness its  major disadvantage  his teacher   the only one who listened to his plea but couldn t sympathize publicly","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v5-p127-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kanzaki&#x27;s principled one-vote stand<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.127–138<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"hoshinomiya-chie.html\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I can only believe that everyone is suffering from normality bias if they don&#x27;t think it&#x27;s abnormal that 39 opposing votes were gathered without any hesitation or doubt.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If the lower classes prioritize class points over a classmate, then we&#x27;ll fall down to Class D in this special exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;it&#x27;s the process that I&#x27;m focusing on.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m sorry, but I&#x27;m... not going to let you be unanimous in your opposition to this choice.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Let&#x27;s face it, Shibata. The situation is very different from last year. We&#x27;re in a tight spot right now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.132<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You can choose to agree with me and then expel me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If you don&#x27;t have the courage to take a step forward in this special exam, then you won&#x27;t be able to move up to Class A.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> The &quot;general advisor&quot; who quietly supported the class but can no longer endure its lack of crisis awareness — deliberately votes &quot;for&quot; repeatedly to force debate, names &quot;normality bias,&quot; and offers himself for expulsion as the only way to shake the class; after hours of deadlock he finally gives up and chooses to protect his classmates, letting the vote become unanimous against.<span class=\"pg\">p.127–138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her refusal to weigh points against friends defeats him; he calls her class&#x27;s kindness its &quot;major disadvantage.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.131–132<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hoshinomiya Chie<\/b> His teacher — the only one who listened to his plea but couldn&#x27;t sympathize publicly.<span class=\"pg\">p.127–135<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v5-p7-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v7-p7-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v7-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.7-207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v7-p57-1\">→ After: Kanzaki&#x27;s confession; the resolve to change his class<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v7-p57-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka himeno ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki s confession  the resolve to change his class meets ayanokoji in the special wing at his own request  though ayanokoji called him  grim and wary   what do you want from me   i don t know what i m going to do with the rest of my school life   i probably don t need to tell you now  but our class can t win   i need your advice on  ichinose   how about now  we kept following ichinose s policy and lost class points  we re at the bottom of a pit   i m not going to sink with the current class and ichinose forever   ayanokoji  i ll pay you back for this debt in the final exam  opens up about his silent struggle   ichinose s idealism  protect everyone  can t win  and she won t listen to dissent  reveals his unanimous exam  yes  votes failed to change the class  through ayanokoji s orchestration  reveals to himeno that he may transfer classes  a  betrayal  threat  to shake her out of silence  leaves with renewed resolve to change the class and repay ayanokoji in the final exam  he seeks his advice  then realizes ayanokoji manipulated the conversation with himeno   still resolves to change his class  he reveals his transfer threat to her   a calculated gamble to make her speak up  frustrated by her refusal to listen to dissent   but still believes she can be changed via the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v7-p57-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kanzaki&#x27;s confession; the resolve to change his class<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.57–71<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Meets Ayanokōji in the special wing at his own request (though Ayanokōji called him), grim and wary.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#himeno\">Himeno<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;What do you want from me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I don&#x27;t know what I&#x27;m going to do with the rest of my school life...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I probably don&#x27;t need to tell you now, but our class can&#x27;t win.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I need your advice on... Ichinose.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.59<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;How about now? We kept following Ichinose&#x27;s policy and lost class points. We&#x27;re at the bottom of a pit.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m not going to sink with the current class and Ichinose forever.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ayanokōji, I&#x27;ll pay you back for this debt in the final exam.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Opens up about his silent struggle — Ichinose&#x27;s idealism (protect everyone) can&#x27;t win, and she won&#x27;t listen to dissent; reveals his Unanimous-exam &quot;yes&quot; votes failed to change the class; through Ayanokōji&#x27;s orchestration, reveals to Himeno that he may transfer classes (a &quot;betrayal&quot; threat) to shake her out of silence; leaves with renewed resolve to change the class and repay Ayanokōji in the final exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.57–71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He seeks his advice, then realizes Ayanokōji manipulated the conversation with Himeno — still resolves to change his class.<span class=\"pg\">p.57–71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Himeno<\/b> He reveals his transfer threat to her — a calculated gamble to make her speak up.<span class=\"pg\">p.62–67<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Frustrated by her refusal to listen to dissent — but still believes she can be changed via the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.59–66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v7-p7-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v8-p11-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.11-208<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v9-p91-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami hamaguchi-tetsuya ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki  a secret plan to save ichinose s class at a karaoke gathering he and watanabe press ayanokoji for why ichinose quit the council  worrying she has lost her will to reach class a  he reveals the real reason for the meeting  to build a team to help ichinose s class  bringing in hamaguchi and swearing everyone to secrecy   for the time being  hamaguchi  please sit here   i ve already talked to hamaguchi about helping us on this matter   it s a gamble  it s important to proceed slowly under the radar  but with  he argues the class must act now and  after debate with himeno and watanabe  asks ayanokoji to check on ichinose under the guise of a date  principled and quietly organizing   he has moved from private resistance to actively gathering allies to rescue the class  careful to work under the radar and willing to gamble on trusted outsiders  his classmate whose withdrawal he is trying to reverse  he worries she may give up on class a  recruited as the third member of the team  trusted with the secret and asked to sound out ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v9-p91-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kanzaki: a secret plan to save Ichinose&#x27;s class<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.91–101<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At a karaoke gathering he and Watanabe press Ayanokōji for why Ichinose quit the council, worrying she has lost her will to reach Class A. He reveals the real reason for the meeting: to build a team to help Ichinose&#x27;s class, bringing in Hamaguchi and swearing everyone to secrecy. He argues the class must act now and, after debate with Himeno and Watanabe, asks Ayanokōji to check on Ichinose under the guise of a date.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"hamaguchi-tetsuya.html\">Hamaguchi Tetsuya<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;For the time being... Hamaguchi, please sit here.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.94<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;ve already talked to Hamaguchi about helping us on this matter.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.94<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s a gamble. It&#x27;s important to proceed slowly under the radar, but with...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.95<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Principled and quietly organizing — he has moved from private resistance to actively gathering allies to rescue the class, careful to work under the radar and willing to gamble on trusted outsiders.<span class=\"pg\">p.91–101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> His classmate whose withdrawal he is trying to reverse; he worries she may give up on Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.91–101<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hamaguchi Tetsuya<\/b> Recruited as the third member of the team.<span class=\"pg\">p.93–95<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trusted with the secret and asked to sound out Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.95–100<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v10-p9-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v10-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.9-235<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v11-p11-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v11-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.11-223<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v12_5-p177-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 9 mentioned appears in ch 9  appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y2v12_5-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.9<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.177-191<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned/appears in Ch.9.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Appears in this volume.<span class=\"pg\">p.177-191<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p119-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami andou kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 4   depth read  kanzaki sees the shrinking map stares at the analyst s tablet as the 11 00 event s outer squares are marked as soon to be restricted   it s too early to draw conclusions  but if the next event has a similar mechanic  the probability will be orders of magnitude higher   there s no way to avoid a fight from here on   for now  we ll move to secure it  o14 has little land  so the supplies themselves should be easy to find   we ll split into three groups at once and head to collect the event rewards  sharp and analytical   immediately grasps that the map is shrinking and combat is now unavoidable  momentarily shaken  then refocused by ichinose s message  receives her message not to worry and not to push for o14  class d s analyst operates the tablet he reads","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p119-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 — depth read: Kanzaki sees the shrinking map<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.119–150<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Stares at the analyst&#x27;s tablet as the 11:00 event&#x27;s outer squares are marked as soon-to-be restricted.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s too early to draw conclusions, but if the next event has a similar mechanic, the probability will be orders of magnitude higher.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There&#x27;s no way to avoid a fight from here on—&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;For now, we&#x27;ll move to secure it. O14 has little land, so the supplies themselves should be easy to find.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;We&#x27;ll split into three groups at once and head to collect the event rewards.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp and analytical — immediately grasps that the map is shrinking and combat is now unavoidable; momentarily shaken, then refocused by Ichinose&#x27;s message.<span class=\"pg\">p.126–127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Receives her message not to worry and not to push for O14.<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">andou<\/b> Class D&#x27;s analyst operates the tablet he reads.<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p126-1\">→ After: Kanzaki sees the map shrinking<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p126-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ichinose-honami andou-sayo kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji kanzaki sees the map shrinking stares at andou s tablet as the 11 a m  event marks the outer squares as soon to be restricted   it s too early to draw conclusions  but if the next event has a similar mechanic  the probability will be orders of magnitude higher   there s no way to avoid a fight from here on out   if one or two more prohibited areas are created today by shrinking the perimeter  we should probably consider making a major move  sharp and analytical   immediately grasps that the map is shrinking inward each event and combat is unavoidable  worries about the detour and class a s ambush risk in the north  is called back to the present when his name is repeatedly called  ichinose s earlier message told him not to push for o14  class d s analyst operates the tablet he reads","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p126-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kanzaki sees the map shrinking<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.126<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Stares at Andou&#x27;s tablet as the 11 a.m. event marks the outer squares as soon-to-be-restricted.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"andou-sayo.html\">Andō Sayo<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It&#x27;s too early to draw conclusions, but if the next event has a similar mechanic, the probability will be orders of magnitude higher.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There&#x27;s no way to avoid a fight from here on out—&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If one or two more prohibited areas are created today by shrinking the perimeter, we should probably consider making a major move.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp and analytical — immediately grasps that the map is shrinking inward each event and combat is unavoidable; worries about the detour and Class A&#x27;s ambush risk in the north.<span class=\"pg\">p.126–127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Is called back to the present when his name is repeatedly called; Ichinose&#x27;s earlier message told him not to push for O14.<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Andō Sayo<\/b> Class D&#x27;s analyst operates the tablet he reads.<span class=\"pg\">p.126<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p119-1\">← Before: Ch.4 — depth read: Kanzaki sees the shrinking map<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p151-1\">→ After: Ch.5 — depth read: Kanzaki&#x27;s armed scrutiny<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p151-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami ayanokouji-atsuomi kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 5   depth read  kanzaki s armed scrutiny leads ten class d guards in a wall  guns trained on ayanokoji and hashimoto as they approach unarmed   i wonder about that  there s a possibility your allies are hiding nearby   just three people ain t gonna do nothin   if we defeat the two of you here  we can significantly lower our chances of coming in last  this is a golden opportunity   what if we trust you and are betrayed  that would be a crisis for our class   i forgot to tell you something important  regarding the chain of command from here on  ichinose has said to entrust everything to you  ayanokouji   you have the power to turn the tide of battle all by yourself  stern  loyal to ichinose and initially hostile  but principled   lowers his guns once briefed  yet remains troubled by why ayanokoji proposed the alliance  confronts him at gunpoint  then accepts the alliance and questions his motives  fully loyal  reports that she entrusted command to ayanokoji  admires ayanokoji s father  which colors his high opinion of ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p151-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 — depth read: Kanzaki&#x27;s armed scrutiny<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.151–166<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Leads ten Class D guards in a wall, guns trained on Ayanokōji and Hashimoto as they approach unarmed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-atsuomi.html\">Ayanokōji Atsuomi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I wonder about that. There&#x27;s a possibility your allies are hiding nearby.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Just three people ain&#x27;t gonna do nothin&#x27;.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If we defeat the two of you here, we can significantly lower our chances of coming in last. This is a golden opportunity.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;What if we trust you and are betrayed? That would be a crisis for our class.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I forgot to tell you something important. Regarding the chain of command from here on, Ichinose has said to entrust everything to you, Ayanokouji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You have the power to turn the tide of battle all by yourself.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.164<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Stern, loyal to Ichinose and initially hostile, but principled — lowers his guns once briefed, yet remains troubled by why Ayanokōji proposed the alliance.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Confronts him at gunpoint, then accepts the alliance and questions his motives.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Fully loyal; reports that she entrusted command to Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Atsuomi<\/b> Admires Ayanokōji&#x27;s father, which colors his high opinion of Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.164<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p126-1\">← Before: Kanzaki sees the map shrinking<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p155-1\">→ After: The armed reception; lowering the guns<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p155-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji the armed reception  lowering the guns leads ten class d guards in a wall  guns trained on ayanokoji and hashimoto as they approach unarmed   halt   i wonder about that  there s a possibility your allies are hiding nearby   if your commander is using tactics  that s not necessarily the case  as you should be well aware   it seems you were caught in a surprise attack by ryuuen and lost the morning battle as well   if we defeat the two of you here  we can significantly lower our chances of coming in last  this is a golden opportunity   an alliance  what if we trust you and are betrayed  that would be a crisis for our class   you can bring your allies  as you wish  let s talk first   ichinose told us that class c might make contact at some point  she also warned us not to make the first move until we were attacked  holds a disciplined armed line and probes their story about gps jamming  then lowers his gun once ayanokoji s reasoning and ichinose s prior briefing align  stern and loyal to ichinose but principled   no hostility once the logic is clear  willing to talk rather than fire  confronts him at gunpoint then accepts the alliance  acts on her instruction not to attack first  debates the gps jamming possibilities with him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p155-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The armed reception; lowering the guns<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.155–157<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Leads ten Class D guards in a wall, guns trained on Ayanokōji and Hashimoto as they approach unarmed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;—Halt.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I wonder about that. There&#x27;s a possibility your allies are hiding nearby.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If your commander is using tactics, that&#x27;s not necessarily the case, as you should be well aware.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It seems you were caught in a surprise attack by Ryuuen and lost the morning battle as well.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If we defeat the two of you here, we can significantly lower our chances of coming in last. This is a golden opportunity.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;An alliance... What if we trust you and are betrayed? That would be a crisis for our class.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You can bring your allies. As you wish, let&#x27;s talk first.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.156<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ichinose told us that Class C might make contact at some point. She also warned us not to make the first move until we were attacked.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Holds a disciplined armed line and probes their story about GPS jamming, then lowers his gun once Ayanokōji&#x27;s reasoning and Ichinose&#x27;s prior briefing align.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Stern and loyal to Ichinose but principled — no hostility once the logic is clear, willing to talk rather than fire.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Confronts him at gunpoint then accepts the alliance.<span class=\"pg\">p.155–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Acts on her instruction not to attack first.<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Debates the GPS-jamming possibilities with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p151-1\">← Before: Ch.5 — depth read: Kanzaki&#x27;s armed scrutiny<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p162-1\">→ After: Serving duty; questioning Ayanokōji&#x27;s motives<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p162-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shibata-sou ayanokouji-atsuomi kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji serving duty  questioning ayanokoji s motives interrupts shibata s greeting to speak with ayanokoji at the campfire   i forgot to tell you something important  regarding the chain of command from here on  ichinose has said to entrust everything to you  ayanokouji   my satisfaction is irrelevant  ichinose is the leader of class d   there s something that i just can t seem to accept   why did you propose something as unprofitable as an alliance with class d   you have the power to turn the tide of battle all by yourself   i can t shake the feeling that they re still out of our reach  but i suppose ichinose believes  believes that with you  we can aim for that  loyal  humble and still troubled   accepts ichinose s command transfer without complaint but needs to understand why ayanokoji helped  slowly won over  questions his motives  overestimates him based on two years of watching  and is urged to share ichinose s confidence  cuts off his conversation with ayanokoji  shibata flees  admires atsuomi  as his father did  which raises his opinion of ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p162-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Serving duty; questioning Ayanokōji&#x27;s motives<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.162–166<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Interrupts Shibata&#x27;s greeting to speak with Ayanokōji at the campfire.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shibata-sou.html\">Shibata Sō<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-atsuomi.html\">Ayanokōji Atsuomi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I forgot to tell you something important. Regarding the chain of command from here on, Ichinose has said to entrust everything to you, Ayanokouji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;My satisfaction is irrelevant. Ichinose is the leader of Class D.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;...There&#x27;s something that I just can&#x27;t seem to accept.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Why did you propose something as unprofitable as an alliance with Class D?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You have the power to turn the tide of battle all by yourself.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.165<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I can&#x27;t shake the feeling that they&#x27;re still out of our reach... But I suppose Ichinose believes; believes that with you, we can aim for that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.165<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Loyal, humble and still troubled — accepts Ichinose&#x27;s command transfer without complaint but needs to understand why Ayanokōji helped; slowly won over.<span class=\"pg\">p.162–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Questions his motives, overestimates him based on two years of watching, and is urged to share Ichinose&#x27;s confidence.<span class=\"pg\">p.162–166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shibata Sō<\/b> Cuts off his conversation with Ayanokōji; Shibata flees.<span class=\"pg\">p.162–163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Atsuomi<\/b> Admires Atsuomi (as his father did), which raises his opinion of Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.165<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p155-1\">← Before: The armed reception; lowering the guns<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p167-1\">→ After: Ch.6 — depth read: Kanzaki&#x27;s report and debate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p167-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hashimoto-masayoshi moriyama kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ch 6   depth read  kanzaki s report and debate  i was just saying that we ve reached a difficult phase  we ve used most of our handheld provisions   also  sumida and minamikata have seemed somewhat unwell since this morning   that s right  i want to avoid the risk of pushing ourselves unnecessarily  losing stamina  or getting injured   to prevent them from narrowing down our vip  we ll assign several mobile guards from our class   however  waiting right on the edge of the designated area has its own risks  practical and cautious   reports the alliance s dwindling supplies and illness  and argues for positioning at h10 for flexibility  receives his strategic explanations and carries out supply positioning plans  debates positioning with him  sends him to relay ayanokoji s words to the unwell students","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p167-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 — depth read: Kanzaki&#x27;s report and debate<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.167–196<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"moriyama.html\">Moriyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I was just saying that we&#x27;ve reached a difficult phase. We&#x27;ve used most of our handheld provisions.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Also, Sumida and Minamikata have seemed somewhat unwell since this morning.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;That&#x27;s right. I want to avoid the risk of pushing ourselves unnecessarily, losing stamina, or getting injured.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;To prevent them from narrowing down our VIP, we&#x27;ll assign several mobile guards from our class.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;However, waiting right on the edge of the designated area has its own risks.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Practical and cautious — reports the alliance&#x27;s dwindling supplies and illness, and argues for positioning at H10 for flexibility.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Receives his strategic explanations and carries out supply/positioning plans.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Debates positioning with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Moriyama<\/b> Sends him to relay Ayanokōji&#x27;s words to the unwell students.<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p162-1\">← Before: Serving duty; questioning Ayanokōji&#x27;s motives<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p174-1\">→ After: Reporting supplies and illness; debating expansion<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p174-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka hashimoto-masayoshi kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji reporting supplies and illness  debating expansion reports to ayanokoji at the alliance base   i was just saying that we ve reached a difficult phase  we ve used most of our handheld provisions   also  sumida and minamikata have seemed somewhat unwell since this morning   there s a troublesome presence in class a from the start  needless to say  it s koenji   then should we attack instead   that s right  i want to avoid the risk of pushing ourselves unnecessarily   however  waiting right on the edge of the designated area has its own risks   we can secure a better position if we move now  practical and cautious   reports the alliance s dwindling food and illness  reasons that koenji s unpredictability justified ryuen not attacking class a  and argues for the h10 position  receives his strategic instructions and carries them out  debates whether to move forward or wait","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p174-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Reporting supplies and illness; debating expansion<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.174–178<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Reports to Ayanokōji at the alliance base.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I was just saying that we&#x27;ve reached a difficult phase. We&#x27;ve used most of our handheld provisions.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Also, Sumida and Minamikata have seemed somewhat unwell since this morning.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There&#x27;s a troublesome presence in Class A from the start. Needless to say, it&#x27;s Koenji.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Then should we attack instead?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.177<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;That&#x27;s right. I want to avoid the risk of pushing ourselves unnecessarily.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;However, waiting right on the edge of the designated area has its own risks.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;We can secure a better position if we move now.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Practical and cautious — reports the alliance&#x27;s dwindling food and illness, reasons that Kōenji&#x27;s unpredictability justified Ryūen not attacking Class A, and argues for the H10 position.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Receives his strategic instructions and carries them out.<span class=\"pg\">p.174–180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Debates whether to move forward or wait.<span class=\"pg\">p.180<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p167-1\">← Before: Ch.6 — depth read: Kanzaki&#x27;s report and debate<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p182-1\">→ After: Ninomiya&#x27;s fever<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p182-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"","w":"kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ninomiya s fever kanzaki nods when ayanokoji orders the ill ninomiya to retire  amikura stays anxiously by her side","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p182-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ninomiya&#x27;s fever<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.182<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kanzaki nods when Ayanokōji orders the ill Ninomiya to retire; Amikura stays anxiously by her side.<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p174-1\">← Before: Reporting supplies and illness; debating expansion<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p233-1\">→ After: Epilogue — depth read: the guard who relays the map<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p233-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji epilogue   depth read  the guard who relays the map spreads out a map for the breathless yamamura and reports the surviving class b members and their location   the ones left in class b are ryuuen and ibuki  as well as yamashita and yoshimoto  their location is d11   i appreciate it  but doesn t this break the rules   but what about you  do you have enough ammo   then i can t accept this  you should be able to use it more effectively than me  practical and rule conscious   takes charge of the map and intel  and hesitates to accept ayanokoji s spare magazines until he is assured his leader has enough  receives two spare magazines from him to protect the class d vips  protects her class s vips  beppu and himeno  in the final stage","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p233-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue — depth read: the guard who relays the map<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.233–252<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Spreads out a map for the breathless Yamamura and reports the surviving Class B members and their location.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;The ones left in Class B are Ryuuen and Ibuki, as well as Yamashita and Yoshimoto. Their location is D11—&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I appreciate it, but doesn&#x27;t this break the rules—?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;But what about you? Do you have enough ammo?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Then I can&#x27;t accept this. You should be able to use it more effectively than me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Practical and rule-conscious — takes charge of the map and intel, and hesitates to accept Ayanokōji&#x27;s spare magazines until he is assured his leader has enough.<span class=\"pg\">p.233–234<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Receives two spare magazines from him to protect the Class D VIPs.<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Protects her class&#x27;s VIPs, Beppu and Himeno, in the final stage.<span class=\"pg\">p.233<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y3v3-p182-1\">← Before: Ninomiya&#x27;s fever<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y0-p225-1","v":"y0","y":0,"o":36,"k":"narration","w":"fuji ishigami-kyou kanzaki-tomohiro ayanokouji-kiyotaka kanzaki-ryuuji","q":"kanzaki ryuji ryuuji at the party  the autograph dispute and the lecture present among the children disputing whether fuji received kazuya s autograph   it doesn t matter to me  whichever is fine   if i have to judge objectively  i think he s lying  it d be better to apologize sooner  objective and pragmatic   judges fuji is lying and urges apology given the numbers and physique against him  quiet and avert his gaze shy when introduced to atsuomi  judges him to be lying  calls him out as  exceptionally talented  can t help snapping at him  his father  president of kanzaki engineering  who dotes on him and touts his black belt level karate skill  is lectured by atsuomi about using one s power to help others   a calculated move to keep his father s investment  moved  he bows happily  atsuomi notices an inconsistency  the father claims ryuuji is black belt level in karate  yet ryuuji did little when fuji was bullied","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kanzaki-ryuuji-y0-p225-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ryuuji at the party: the autograph dispute and the lecture<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Side stories · p.225–237<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Present among the children disputing whether Fuji received Kazuya&#x27;s autograph.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"index.html#fuji\">Fuji<\/a> · <a href=\"ishigami-kyou.html\">Ishigami Kyō<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#kanzaki-tomohiro\">Kanzaki Tomohiro<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;It doesn&#x27;t matter to me. Whichever is fine.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q narration\">&quot;If I have to judge objectively, I think he&#x27;s lying. It&#x27;d be better to apologize sooner.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Objective and pragmatic — judges Fuji is lying and urges apology given the numbers and physique against him; quiet and avert-his-gaze shy when introduced to Atsuomi.<span class=\"pg\">p.225–237<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Fuji<\/b> Judges him to be lying.<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> Calls him out as &quot;exceptionally talented&quot;; can&#x27;t help snapping at him.<span class=\"pg\">p.228<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kanzaki Tomohiro<\/b> His father, president of Kanzaki Engineering, who dotes on him and touts his black-belt-level karate skill.<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Is lectured by Atsuomi about using one&#x27;s power to help others — a calculated move to keep his father&#x27;s investment; moved, he bows happily.<span class=\"pg\">p.236–237<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Atsuomi notices an inconsistency: the father claims Ryuuji is black-belt-level in karate, yet Ryuuji did little when Fuji was bullied.<span class=\"pg\">p.234<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"}];
